  "slug": "number-of-ways-to-stay-in-the-same-place-after-some-steps",
  "title": "停在原地的方案数",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-018",
  "studyTags": [
    "动态规划",
    "滚动数组"
  ],
  "summary": "从数组下标零出发，每步可左移、右移或停留且不能越界，统计恰好 steps 步后仍在零的方案数，结果取模。",
  "insight": "最远只可能走到 steps/2 后还来得及返回，因此把位置状态截断到 min(arrLen,steps/2+1)；每轮从本位和相邻位置转移。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "数组右边界不能越过 arrLen-1",
    "停留也是一种独立操作",
    "每轮必须使用新数组"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "bounded-position-rolling-dp",
      "title": "有界位置滚动动态规划",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "仅保留可能在剩余步数内回到零的位置。",
      "steps": [
        "limit=min(arrLen,steps/2+1)，dp[0]=1",
        "重复 steps 次，对 position 累加 dp[position] 到 stay、left、right 合法位置",
        "每次对模数取余并替换 dp，返回 dp[0]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(steps·min(arrLen,steps))",
        "space": "O(min(arrLen,steps))"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/bounded-position-rolling-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/bounded-position-rolling-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/bounded-position-rolling-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
